comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-06T18:44:48.723Z",codex-agent,"Public source proof: twenty-four reviewed passages from immutable public pm-csv, pm-beads and pm-ops commits. All three selected scoped upstream harnesses pass in disposable public copies with their pinned dependencies. Restoring only the historical nonzero-close shortcut reproduces pm-csv-zv31: closed item retains transaction markers; restoring the fixed function passes again. Primary matrices cover 23/23, 39/39 and 24/24 feasible pairs with six cases each, versus 12, 24 and 16 feasible full assignments. One reported passing and one unavailable observation per primary suite; failing historical variant is retained under a different subject model. Ten independent resume answers agree and use 26151 bytes versus 97937 bytes of source plus naive assignments."
  "2026-11-06T19:11:21.180Z",codex-agent,"Final public proof expands the tenth question to exact missing assignments across every resume page. Ten independent answers match through 14 calls: 42044 delivered bytes versus 97937 naive baseline bytes, 57.07 percent fewer, maximum page 3836 bytes. Three six-case pairwise suites cover 23, 39 and 24 feasible pairs; execution subsets cover 6, 10 and 6. Exhaustive three-way references use 12, 24 and 16 cases and remain explicitly outside the product generator. Latest completed source coverage before final integrity assertions: 65 tests; 536 statements, 294 branches, 162 functions and 424 lines all covered. Production audit has zero vulnerabilities; pack allowlist has 41 files. Final unchanged-candidate npm and Bun release checks include the strengthened packed negative journeys and are required before handoff."
  "2026-11-06T19:12:07.397Z",codex-agent,Linked public corpus and real-data receipt checks pass 4 tests. Domain-only tracker tests use the default schema/source workspace context; an empty isolated workspace intentionally lacks package test files. Final proof refresh separately measures the regression invocation timing so its receipt does not inherit the passing baseline duration.
  "2026-11-06T19:14:33.471Z",codex-agent,"Refreshed public harness proof passes all three selected source tests and reproduces the historical CSV regression, then passes after restoration. Separate measured invocation durations are retained. Recomputed real-data proof retains all ten equal answers and the documented counts and byte reduction. Linked privacy and frozen-proof tests pass 4 of 4. Final npm and Bun release gates will validate this committed source and evidence snapshot; gate logs remain local and untracked."
  "2026-11-06T19:44:45.204Z",codex-agent,"Completed local release gates on implementation commit 0959899: npm and Bun each passed all fourteen stages. Both measured 66 tests, zero failures/skips, and 100 percent coverage of 539 statements, 298 branches, 163 functions and 426 lines over eight emitted modules. Packed acceptance passed 31 CLI checks per manager plus SDK and Node compatibility checks; both captures had identical SHA-256. Four behavioral mutants failed and all four restored versions passed. Audit zero production vulnerabilities; pack 41 allowlisted files; docstrings 96 declarations; duplication zero. Public PR review and CI are now tracked on the release epic."
